      "created_at": "2013-04-28T17:59:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I believe cards like Young Legacy, Rook City Wraith, Horus Ra and Reedemer Fanatic are out of print.</p><p>Freedom Six, Dark Visionary, Greatest Legacy and Eternal Haka might still be available in conventions earned through sentinel points.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&gt;G has mentioned they will print a full promo pack once the series is done. For now you can print them off from Boardgame geek:&nbsp;http://boardgamegeek.com/filepage/85258/sotm-out-of-print-promos-heroes-villains</p>",
